{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2020-09-23 04:30:00', 'title': 'SES BECOMES MICROSOFT AZURE ORBITAL FOUNDING CONNECTIVITY PARTNER', 'text': 'SES ANNOUNCED ON TUESDAY IT BECAME MICROSOFT AZURE ORBITAL FOUNDING CONNECTIVITY PARTNER .INTEGRATION IS PART OF A MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE TWO COMPANIES.TWO COMPANIES WILL MAKE JOINT INVESTMENTS IN AZURE ORBITAL GROUND STATIONS THAT SES WILL DEPLOY AND MANAGE FOR THE MEO AND EARTH OBSERVATION SEGMENT.'}